From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenCode <opencode@localhost>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: phoenix: enable PMIC vibrator

The PM6150 vibrator node is disabled in the shared PMIC description. Enable
it on Phoenix; the mainline pmi632-compatible vibrator driver already handles
the PM6150 register layout.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7150-xiaomi-phoenix.dts | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7150-xiaomi-phoenix.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7150-xiaomi-phoenix.dts
index 1..2 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7150-xiaomi-phoenix.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7150-xiaomi-phoenix.dts
@@ -132,1 +132,5 @@
+&pm6150_vib {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &pm6150_gpios {
